 effects (HTE)</article-title><source>Am J Med</source><year>2007</year><volume>120</volume><fpage>S1</fpage><lpage>S2</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.amjmed.2007.02.001</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Greenfield S. Introduction to supplemental articles on heterogeneity of treatment effects (HTE). Am J Med. 2007;120:S1&#x02013;2. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17981159</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>